<metadata><name>Mount Wilson Summit - Eastside Approach</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:170-1: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.080563" lon="-121.540950"><ele>846.5</ele><name>S-549 at Highway 26 (roadside parking)</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:beaver-butte-creek-road-s-549 (OSM node 36219980); DEM 2,777 ft; confidence: high; pdf_page: 172; book_elev_ft: 2800; quote: Drive 4.9 miles on Highway 26 beyond its junction with Highway 216 to the obscure Beaver Butte Creek Road S-549 ... The low elevation (2,800 feet)</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.062600" lon="-121.638300"><ele>1433.2</ele><name>S-549 / Eastside Road junction (4,680')</name><desc>source: OSM: start of unnamed track way 679216437 (north, the book's Eastside Road S506G) on S-549 way 5195562; DEM 4,702 ft; confidence: high; pdf_page: 171; book_elev_ft: 4680; quote: map 38: S549 5.5 ... 4680'</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.054000" lon="-121.638400"><ele>1497.7</ele><name>Road end (4,928')</name><desc>source: OSM: south end of BIA Road 42 way 5192628, which continues S-549; DEM 4,914 ft; confidence: high; pdf_page: 171; book_elev_ft: 4928; quote: map 38: 0.6 ... 4928'</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.066370" lon="-121.658320"><ele>1701.2</ele><name>Mount Wilson summit</name><desc>source: GNIS Mount Wilson (geonames MapServer); DEM 5,581 ft; confidence: high; pdf_page: 172; book_elev_ft: 5599; quote: The rounded summit is the site of a former lookout cabin.</desc></wpt>
